\item[S2] Llu\'is Alsed\`a, Antonio Garijo and Xavier Jarque, \emph{Mersenne numbers and the doubling map}, arXiv:2605.29130 (2026), Section 1. \url{https://arxiv.org/abs/2605.29130}.
